From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 15:35:40 -0647
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: arm: google: Add Pixel 9a (tegu)

Add the Pixel 9a, the first Tensor G4 (zumapro) board. Its bootloader
picks the base DTB by /soc_compatible, which this schema already
describes for every Google board, and it boots with an empty /ect node,
so the zuma-only ECT parameters stay zuma-only.

Link: https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/devices/google/zumapro/+/8831630eee2ad095b85ed452944e6353940966a5/dts/zumapro-a0-ipop.dts
Link: https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/devices/google/zumapro/+/8831630eee2ad095b85ed452944e6353940966a5/dts/zumapro-a1-ipop.dts
Signed-off-by: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/google.yaml | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/google.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/google.yaml
index 0734306a4..d7b7eed97 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/google.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/google.yaml
@@ -52,6 +52,11 @@ properties:
           - enum:
               - google,zuma-husky
           - const: google,zuma
+      - description: Google Tensor G4 (zumapro) boards
+        items:
+          - enum:
+              - google,zumapro-tegu
+          - const: google,zumapro
 
   # Bootloader requires an ect node to be present: empty on gs101 and gs201,
   # with the location of the ECT blob on zuma
